; Chalice flag: the chalice of Satan's room has been taken
;
; 0, or $FF once the player has touched the chalice in room 24 (item type 11, #R$A734; the chalice only exists while
; 12 crosses are collected, see #R$854D). The enemy code of Satan #R$BB57 tests it: while it is 0 Satan moves and
; attacks, once it is set he turns into a cloud of smoke (once, see #R$8522). The crosses routine #R$AE4B stops adding
; crosses and the red scroll (item type 6, #R$A668) appears: touching it starts the ending. Never cleared except by a
; new game.
@label=ChaliceTaken
g$8521 DEFB $00
